# Settings from Home's gear; 外观 → 浅色, then 深色: the app is drawn so at once (its host told: the log's "theme: …",
# light then dark, whatever the machine's own is), and the core keeps it on the device (the prefs' appearance).
timeout 60000
until 端到端测试
tap icon:settings
until Workspace
until 外观
shot 1-settings
tap 外观
until 跟随系统
shot 2-appearance
tap =浅色
shot 3-light
tap =深色
shot 4-dark
back
until Workspace
shot 5-settings-dark
# (the core keeps the appearance on the device behind: 34 starts from it)
wait 1500
